  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A body of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> splits into four masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which are rearranged to form a square as shown in the figure. The ratio of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math> for which, the gravitational potential energy of the system becomes maximum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is ________.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4e8a3408-ec6f-4054-ba31-4d08e7441086-image.png\" style=\"width: 235px; height: 264px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/79115e95-c4db-4934-846c-7ced061eb663-image.png\" style=\"width: 272px; height: 285px;\" /></p><p>For maxima or minima of potential energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>G</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
